              "size": 14
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Strategic People Leader and hands-on HRBP. I partner with executive leaders and C-suite\nexecutives to align people strategy with business objectives, drive culture transformation and\nscale organisation capabilities during growth. Experience across high-growth technology\nand global FMCG in international organisations leading on talent strategy, org design and\nemployee relations.",
