              "y": 168.506,
              "size": 10.001
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "I operate with transparency, empathy and pragmatism to balance commercial outcomes with\na genuine care for people. I bring energy, humour and a sense of authenticity to the\nworkplace to foster an environment where engaged employees can perform at their best.",
